              "type": "text",
              "text": "What is the drip rate per minute for 1.25 L of fluid over 8 h, with a drip size giving 14 drops/mL?",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Round to the nearest whole.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$36\\text{ drops/min}$",
      "worked": "The quantities are drops, volume and time.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Volume}}\\times\\frac{\\text{Volume}}{\\text{Time}}\\\\\n\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{14\\text{ drops}}{1\\text{ mL}}\\times\\frac{1.25\\text{ L}}{8\\text{ h}}\\\\\n\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{14\\text{ drops}}{1\\text{ mL}}\\times\\frac{1250\\text{ mL}}{480\\text{ min}}\\\\\n\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{875}{24}\\text{ drops/min}\\\\\n\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&\\approx36\\text{ drops/min}\n\\end{align*}$$\n\nRounded to the nearest whole number.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 48
